{"id":"wb-6-587","name":"狮峰寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"狮峰寺","text":"狮峰寺，原名西峰院（又作西峰寺），是位于中国福建省福安市溪柄镇柏柱洋村狮子峰山麓的佛教寺院，其建筑艺术与科学价值较高，亦曾是中共闽东特委的活动地。2006年，狮峰寺被中国国务院列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%8B%AE%E5%B3%B0%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":94816994,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94816994","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8375a7223d1068062a95f64f.jpg","title":"狮峰寺_20251002_09.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%8B%AE%E5%B3%B0%E5%AF%BA_20251002_09.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/64/%E7%8B%AE%E5%B3%B0%E5%AF%BA_20251002_09.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"FradonStar","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0","caption":"​位于中国福建省福安市的狮峰寺，全国重点文物保护单位","width":320,"height":240}}